{"ticker":{"symbol":"011930.KS","name":"신성이엔지","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":12500.0,"change_pct":-0.006359300476947549,"market_cap":253827268608.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":10920.0,"week52_high":49700.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"South Korea","city":"Gwacheon-si","employees":507,"website":"https://www.shinsungeng.com/kor","business_summary":"Shinsung E&G Co.,Ltd. provides solar modules and solar systems in Korea and internationally. The company operates through Clean Environment and Renewable Energy Business. The company offers clean room installation, FFU, EFU equipment manufacturing and secondary battery manufacturing, as well as dry room installation; and manufactures and sells solar modules, constructs power plants, and conducts operations and management. The company was formerly known as Shinsung Solar Energy Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Shinsung E&G Co.,Ltd. in March 2017. Shinsung E&G Co.,Ltd. was founded in 1977 and is headquartered in Gwacheon-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)신성이앤지 국내는 물론 해외에 태양광 모듈, 태양광 시스템을 공급하고 있습니다. 회사는 청정환경과 신재생에너지 사업을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 클린룸 설치, FFU, EFU 장비 제조 및 2차 배터리 제조는 물론 건조실 설치도 제공합니다. 태양광 모듈 제조 및 판매, 발전소 건설, 운영 및 관리를 수행합니다. 사명은 신성솔라에너지(주)에서 신성이앤지(주)로 사명을 변경하였습니다. 2017년 3월. (주)신성이앤지 1977년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 과천시에 위치하고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"건축 제품 및 장비","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":664143679910.0,"operating_income":21021027820.0,"net_income":34126501100.0,"eps":1680.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":576519652360.0,"operating_income":7357387660.0,"net_income":16227241060.0,"eps":800.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":582301298380.0,"operating_income":4991741660.0,"net_income":-14083077300.0,"eps":-690.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":56745